Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:55:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Persist V4 recovery evidence and atomic terminal receipts

Integration note (2026-10-15): the original source commit had no message body.
This explanation is supplied by the series integrator; source diff bytes are unchanged.

Preserve V3 journals while adding V4 fixed-size evidence slots, historical-parent binding and atomic terminal receipts. Gate dispatch on pending terminal work and invalid ancestry; unknown or deferred outcomes never create invalidity facts.

Validation scope and exact-source evidence are recorded in the implementation plan.

